Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:00:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1105/1286] The bar's logo loses only its words (1147): the
 compact logo cut from the main one (1.4 : 1, her height kept, the cloud
 fading at the sides) in the square's place; the square is the favicon only

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css    | 11 ++++++-----
 tools/console/index.html | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 277cccd..29ba622 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3106,15 +3106,16 @@ input[type="search"]::-webkit-search-cancel-button { cursor: pointer; }
 /* ---------------------------------------------------------------- HERESY 1119: the logo in the dead centre of the bar
    Out of the flow, so the bar's own things keep their places; it takes no clicks. She descends below the bar's edge:
    in a browser tab nothing may rise above the window (an installed app with Window Controls Overlay could). The
-   workspace picker moves beside the buttons, clear of her. Too narrow for the words: the woman alone, on her square;
-   narrower still: the square back at the start of the bar. */
+   workspace picker moves beside the buttons, clear of her. Too narrow for the words: the logo without them, the same
+   woman and cloud at the same height (1147, Viktor 03.10: «лого при скейле страницы будет терять только свой текст»);
+   narrower still: that, at the start of the bar. The square is the favicon only. */
 .topbar .brand { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); height: 52px; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; display: block; }
 .topbar .brand .brand-logo { display: block; height: 100%; }
 .brand-full { display: block; height: 62px; width: auto; overflow: visible; }
-.brand-icon { display: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; margin-top: 4px; border-radius: 9px; }   /* the square, its corners softened in the bar only */
+.brand-compact { display: none; height: 62px; width: auto; overflow: visible; }   /* 1.4 : 1, cut from the bar's copy */
 .topbar .ws-current + .spacer { display: none; }
-@media (max-width: 1659px) { .brand-full { display: none; } .brand-icon { display: block; } }
-@media (max-width: 1359px) { .topbar .brand { position: static; transform: none; height: auto; order: -1; } .brand-icon { margin-top: 0; } }
+@media (max-width: 1659px) { .brand-full { display: none; } .brand-compact { display: block; } }
+@media (max-width: 1359px) { .topbar .brand { position: static; transform: none; height: 52px; order: -1; } }   /* she hangs below, as above */
 
 /* HERESY 1121: the engine's lamp alone, after the workspace (its words in the tip, and kept for screen readers) */
 .topbar .engine-chip { order: 0; padding: 8px 4px; cursor: default; }
